  "headline": "Prabowo Subianto Announces New Teacher Support And Training Plans",
  "seoTitle": "Prabowo Subianto National Teacher Day Announcements",
  "metaDescription": "President Prabowo Subianto announced teacher welfare measures, training programs, and the launch of Studio Guru on National Teacher Day 2026.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "President Prabowo Subianto launched the Studio Guru initiative for distance learning during the National Teacher Day 2026 event.",
    "The government plans to send 3,350 teachers for international training in Canada and Russia starting in 2027.",
    "New welfare measures include over 90 trillion rupiah in total allowances and the transition of 52,000 honorary staff to contract status."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "On the occasion of National Teacher Day 2026, President Prabowo Subianto attended the national ceremony held at the Sentul International Convention Center (SICC) in Bogor. During the event, the administration introduced several initiatives aimed at improving teacher welfare and professional capabilities. Key announcements included the official launch of the Studio Guru program for distance education and a commitment to international professional development, with plans to send thousands of teachers for training in Canada and Russia beginning in 2027. The government also confirmed significant financial investments, noting that total teacher allowance funding will exceed 90 trillion rupiah. Furthermore, efforts to address employment status for honorary teachers are underway, with 52,000 individuals designated for appointment as government employees under contract (PPPK). The president emphasized the importance of fostering a supportive and compassionate learning environment for students across Indonesia.",
